"in te stellen."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1288
msgid "Movies and series"
msgstr "Films en series"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1289
msgid ""
"Posters with long titles scroll when you point at them. Open one to see the "
"details and the cast; click an actor to see their other titles in your "
"playlists."
msgstr ""
"Posters met lange titels scrollen als u ernaar wijst. Open er een om de "
"details en de cast te zien; klik op een acteur om diens andere titels in uw "
"afspeellijsten te zien."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1293
msgid "Favorites and recordings"
msgstr "Favorieten en opnamen"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1294
msgid ""
"The heart keeps channels, movies and series here; recordings of live TV are "
"listed in Recordings."
msgstr ""
"Het hartje bewaart zenders, films en series hier; opnamen van live-tv staan "
"onder Opnamen."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1298
msgid ""
"Add M3U or Xtream lists. Each list can have backup servers (other DNS of the "
"provider): the dots show if each one is online, slow or down, and AshyTV "
"switches automatically."
msgstr ""
"Voeg M3U- of Xtream-lijsten toe. Elke lijst kan reserveservers hebben "
"(andere DNS van de aanbieder): de stippen tonen of elk online, traag of "
"offline is, en AshyTV schakelt automatisch over."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1304
msgid ""
"Themes and colors, hidden channels and groups, secure DNS, parental PIN and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Thema's en kleuren, verborgen zenders en groepen, beveiligde DNS, ouderlijke "
"pincode en meer."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1307
msgid "See it again"
msgstr "Opnieuw bekijken"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1308
msgid ""
"Reopen this tour from the main menu (Guided tour) or from Settings → About."
msgstr ""
"Open deze rondleiding opnieuw via het hoofdmenu (Rondleiding) of via "
"Instellingen → Info."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1358
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“{name}”: the main server is not answering. Using the backup server."
msgstr ""
"‘{name}’: de hoofdserver antwoordt niet. De reserveserver wordt gebruikt."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1361
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“{name}”: the main server is back."
msgstr "‘{name}’: de hoofdserver is terug."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1367
msgid "AshyTV servers"
msgstr "AshyTV-servers"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1389
msgid "Switching to the main server…"
msgstr "Overschakelen naar de hoofdserver…"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1390
msgid "Switching to the backup server…"
msgstr "Overschakelen naar de reserveserver…"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1460
msgid "Programme"
msgstr "Programma"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1464
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You will be reminded of “{title}” at {time}"
msgstr "Je wordt om {time} herinnerd aan ‘{title}’"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1465
msgid "Reminder cancelled"
msgstr "Herinnering geannuleerd"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1477
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“{title}” starts soon on {channel}"
msgstr "‘{title}’ begint zo op {channel}"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1479
msgid "AshyTV reminder"
msgstr "AshyTV-herinnering"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1498
msgid "This channel is no longer in your playlists."
msgstr "Dit kanaal staat niet meer in je afspeellijsten."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1538
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Group “{name}” hidden"
msgstr "Groep ‘{name}’ verborgen"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1539
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Category “{name}” hidden"
msgstr "Categorie ‘{name}’ verborgen"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1553
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Channel “{name}” hidden"
msgstr "Zender ‘{name}’ verborgen"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1559
msgid "To show it again: Settings → Hidden channels and groups"
msgstr "Weer tonen: Instellingen → Verborgen zenders en groepen"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1561
msgid "See hidden"
msgstr "Verborgen bekijken"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1566
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Ongedaan maken"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1872
msgid "Could not save now: a playlist is being updated. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Opslaan lukt nu niet: er wordt een afspeellijst bijgewerkt. Probeer het "
"opnieuw."

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.desktop.in:3
#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:4
msgid "AshyTV"
msgstr "AshyTV"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.desktop.in:4
msgid "IPTV Player"
msgstr "IPTV-speler"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.desktop.in:5
msgid "Watch your own IPTV playlists (M3U and Xtream Codes)"
msgstr "Bekijk je eigen IPTV-afspeellijsten (M3U en Xtream Codes)"

#. Translators: search keywords, separated by semicolons; keep the trailing semicolon.
#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.desktop.in:7
msgid "iptv;tv;m3u;xtream;epg;player;live;channels;movies;series;"
msgstr "iptv;tv;m3u;xtream;epg;player;live;channels;movies;series;speler;kanalen;films;"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:5
msgid "Modern IPTV player for your own playlists"
msgstr "Moderne IPTV-speler voor je eigen afspeellijsten"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid "Community Big"
msgstr "Community Big"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"AshyTV is a GTK4/libadwaita IPTV player. Import your own M3U playlist or "
"Xtream Codes account and browse live channels, an electronic program guide, "
"movies and series. AshyTV is only a player: it does not host or sell any "
"content."
msgstr ""
"AshyTV is een IPTV-speler gemaakt met GTK4/libadwaita. Importeer je eigen "
"M3U-afspeellijst of Xtream Codes-account en blader door livezenders, "
"programmagids, films en series. AshyTV is alleen een speler: het host of "
"verkoopt geen inhoud."

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"Optional Free TV: links to free-to-air channels and to public domain or "
"openly licensed films"
msgstr ""
"Optionele gratis tv: links naar vrij te ontvangen zenders en naar films uit "
"het publieke domein of met een open licentie"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Live channels with categories, favorites and now-playing info"
msgstr ""
"Live kanalen met categorieën, favorieten en informatie over wat er nu op is"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Program guide (XMLTV) in a time grid"
msgstr "Programmagids (XMLTV) in een tijdraster"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid "Movies and series catalog with resume and next episode"
msgstr "Film- en seriecatalogus met hervatten en volgende aflevering"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:23
msgid ""
"libmpv playback with hardware decoding, picture-in-picture and recording"
msgstr "Afspelen met libmpv met hardwaredecodering, beeld-in-beeld en opnemen"

